# Office floor plan

![](images/logo.png)

Find your way around the third floor.

Hover over or tap a numbered area to see what is there.

## 1. Third floor

![Third floor](images/01-third-floor.png)

1) **Reception**\
   Sign in here when you arrive.\
   Visitor badges are in the top drawer.
2) **Kitchen \& café**\
   Coffee, tea and fruit. Please load the dishwasher before you leave.
3) **Meeting room "Fjord"**\
   Seats 8. Book it on the panel by the door; to present, press \<Input\> on the remote.
4) **Quiet zone**\
   No calls or meetings.

The lifts open onto the corridor in the middle.

> **Tip:** Need a desk for the day? Ask at **Reception**.

## 2. Fire exits

![Fire exits](images/02-fire-exits.png)

1) **Stairwell B**\
   Use the stairs in a fire, never the lifts.
2) **Stairwell A**\
   Leads to the assembly point in the car park.

